('Raita - Zeera', NULL, NULL, '½ cup of Yogurt
¼ tsp Salt
¼ tsp. ground black pepper (Kali Mirch)
½ tsp. cumin seeds (Zeera) powder or crushed', '1. Whip all the ingredients together & serve', 21, 1.15, 1.72, 1.09, 'N', NULL, NULL, 'Desi Cookbook — https://www.desicookbook.com/raita-zeera/'),
('Raita - Mint', NULL, NULL, '1 cup yogurt
2 green chilies
½ mint (Podina) leaves
¼ tsp. cumin seeds (Zeera) powder
¼ tsp Salt', '1. In a few tablespoons of yogurt, grind all the ingredients together
