½ teaspoon red chilli powder
½ teaspoon salt
1/2 inch piece ginger (peeled, roughly chopped)
Chaat Masala Powder
Red Chilli Powder
Tamarind Chutney
Finely Chopped Cilantro
Coriander/Mint Chutney', '1. Combine the yogurt, sugar and spices along with ½ cup of water and whisk. I suggest starting with half the amount of chilli powder and cumin powder unless like me you are a fan.
